  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471920",
      "title": "Animating Layout Changes",
      "sourceHash": "9e499d3257692100858b6c0b4241ce4ef7c00155d8f1d57d26f89056259ffa85",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 3.15,
          "en": "So at this point, I am quite happy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.15,
          "end": 4.47,
          "en": "with this modal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.47,
          "end": 6.78,
          "en": "And of course we can now use it as we always",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.78,
          "end": 11.64,
          "en": "could to add new challenges to our list of challenges here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.64,
          "end": 14.79,
          "en": "And that's indeed the part I wanna work on next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.79,
          "end": 17.28,
          "en": "because here we got these different tabs, and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.28,
          "end": 20.79,
          "en": "at the moment we don't really have any animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.79,
          "end": 22.083,
          "en": "in those tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.95,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "We have no animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.48,
          "end": 28.08,
          "en": "as we switch tabs and we got no animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.08,
          "end": 31.05,
          "en": "if we have multiple items here and we, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.05,
          "end": 35.85,
          "en": "move one item to a different tab by marking it as completed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.85,
          "end": 39.12,
          "en": "it just disappears here and appears here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.12,
          "end": 42.19,
          "en": "But this list updates without any animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.65,
          "end": 46.23,
          "en": "which also of course could be improved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 48.54,
          "en": "And that's what we'll do next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.54,
          "end": 51.3,
          "en": "And therefore here in this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 54.39,
          "en": "I'll switch to the challenges JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.39,
          "end": 56.61,
          "en": "which is where I have my challenges tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.61,
          "end": 59.253,
          "en": "and this list of challenge items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.51,
          "end": 62.01,
          "en": "And here we could, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.01,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "start by animating these challenge items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 68.4,
          "en": "as we mark them as completed, to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.4,
          "end": 73.4,
          "en": "what I'd like to achieve is that as those items are removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.53,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "the list does not instantly update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 79.02,
          "en": "and snap into place like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.02,
          "end": 79.85300000000001,
          "en": "But instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.85300000000001,
          "end": 83.37,
          "en": "the item that remains here should be animated smoothly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.37,
          "end": 85.923,
          "en": "as the item before it was removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.53999999999999,
          "end": 89.61,
          "en": "And this can easily be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.61,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "by going to this challenge item component where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 95.43,
          "en": "I have this list item that makes up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 97.50999999999999,
          "en": "such a challenge item in my list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 102.243,
          "en": "by replacing this list item with a motion list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 106.56,
          "en": "Now I'm already importing motion here in challenge item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.56,
          "end": 107.393,
          "en": "so we just have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.393,
          "end": 109.173,
          "en": "to Convert LI to motion.li,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 113.523,
          "en": "also the closing tag of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.17,
          "end": 118.86,
          "en": "Now when we do that out of the box, nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.86,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "These items still move instantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 124.47,
          "en": "and the list updates instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.47,
          "end": 125.82300000000001,
          "en": "So nothing changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.11,
          "end": 129.69,
          "en": "But now that this is a motion component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.69,
          "end": 131.82,
          "en": "we can add a special property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.82,
          "end": 136.82,
          "en": "The layout property, if you add this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 141.06,
          "en": "to a motion component, Framer Motion will automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.06,
          "end": 145.26,
          "en": "try to animate layout changes in that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.26,
          "end": 149.46,
          "en": "So in that list item here, in this case, which means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.46,
          "end": 153.966,
          "en": "for example, that if we have a list with two items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.966,
          "end": 158.16,
          "en": "and we move the first item by marking it as failed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.16,
          "end": 160.59,
          "en": "the second item, this item in this case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.59,
          "end": 165.59,
          "en": "of course remains, but it now moves to the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.84,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "And this move to the top would then be animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 170.28300000000002,
          "en": "by Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.66,
          "end": 174.75,
          "en": "And therefore, now with layout added here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.75,
          "end": 178.82999999999998,
          "en": "to this motion component, if I marked this first item as",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.82999999999998,
          "end": 182.051,
          "en": "failed and its therefore gets removed from this list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.051,
          "end": 185.643,
          "en": "you see the second item moves up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.91,
          "end": 189.12,
          "en": "Now, of course, we have no animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.12,
          "end": 191.01,
          "en": "If I mark this as failed as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "because now it's not moving to a different place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 199.23,
          "en": "It's just gone here, it just reappears if I go to this tab.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.23,
          "end": 202.07999999999998,
          "en": "But if I have a scenario where an element needs to move",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.07999999999998,
          "end": 204,
          "en": "to a new position, like here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 207.9,
          "en": "if I mark the first item as completed, now this is animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.9,
          "end": 211.833,
          "en": "If you add this layout prop to the element that is moving.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
